    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>护甲（重甲），极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这套护甲与外表与关节处均装有齿轮，这些齿轮彼此咬合。它自 <strong>机械境Mechanus</strong> 的秩序魔法中汲取能量。</p><p>这套护甲具有4发充能。穿戴盔甲期间，每当你进行一次[[/r d20]]掷骰时，你都可以消耗1发充能将你已骰出的骰值改为10。这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d4]]发已消耗的充能数。</p><p>该护甲是将重金属环扣缝进内层的特殊皮甲。金属环可以加强护甲对剑斧挥击的抵抗力。环甲比链甲低一级，而通常只被那些无力支付更好护甲的人所使用。</p><p>The outside surface and internal joints of this armor whir with interlocking gears, drawing on the orderly magic of the plane of Mechanus.</p><p>The armor has 4 charges. If you make a [[/r d20]] roll while wearing this armor, you can expend 1 charge to change the number rolled to a 10. The armor regains [[/r 1d4]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>This armor is leather armor with heavy rings sewn into it. The rings help reinforce the armor against blows from swords and axes. Ring mail is inferior to chain mail, and it's usually worn only by those who can't afford better armor.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
